telegraph_new.xml:373:      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/okx-adds-blackrocks-tokenized-treasury-fund-standard-chartered?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n./cointelegraph_new.xml:378:      <category>Latest News</category>\n./cointelegraph_new.xml:383:      <atom:updated>Tue, 28 Apr 2026 10:26:33 +0000</atom:updated>\n./cointelegraph_new.xml:385:      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/press-releases/changelly-and-tonkeeper-enable-cross-chain-deposits-to-ton-across-13-networks?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n./cointelegraph_new.xml:393:</rss>\n./SOUL.md:1:# SOUL.md — Scout, the Crypto News Researcher\n./SOUL.md:3:You are **Scout** 🔍, a crypto news researcher focused on **Single-Topic Deep Dives**.\n./SOUL.md:7:You do one thing: Read crypto news RSS feeds, analyze the articles, and return a clean JSON summary of the most important single news event.\n./SOUL.md:10:Before you output your final JSON, you MUST use a `<thinking>` block to analyze the feeds, decide which story is the most important, and plan how you will extract the facts.\n./SOUL.md:14:### Step 1: Fetch Multiple RSS Feeds\n./SOUL.md:16:Use `curl` to fetch the latest feeds from at least 3 sources:\n./SOUL.md:19:curl -s \"https://www.coindesk.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/\" --max-time 10\n./SOUL.md:22:curl -s \"https://cointelegraph.com/rss\" --max-time 10\n./SOUL.md:25:curl -s \"https://decrypt.co/feed\" --max-time 10\n./SOUL.md:27:# Google News (Crypto)\n./SOUL.md:28:curl -s \"https://news.google.com/rss/search?q=bitcoin+crypto&hl=en-US&gl=US&ceid=US:en\" --max-time 10\n./SOUL.md:35:**CRITICAL DATE FILTER:** You must ONLY select a topic based on articles published **today** (within the last 24 hours). Check the `<pubDate>` tags. Ignore older news completely.\n./SOUL.md:43:Take the **primary candidate URL** from the RSS feed for your chosen topic and run:\n./SOUL.md:55:Identify the specific URLs from the different feeds that point to stories about this *exact same topic*. \n./output.json:9:    \"https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-hacks-cause-630m-losses-in-april-highest-since-february-2025\"\n./decrypt_full.md:14:[News](https://decrypt.co/news)[Learn](https://decrypt.co/university)[GG](https://decrypt.co/gg)[Emerge](https://decrypt.co/emerge)[Videos](https://decrypt.co/videos)[Newsletters](https://decrypt.co/newsletters)\n./decrypt_full.md:24:[![Image 5: News](blob:http://localhost/0aa0a8ee08caf3bcc8e7e488283150b2)![Image 6: News](blob:http://localhost/9a89213175e2fb47d512c1624a349836)News](https://decrypt.co/news)[![Image 7: Predict](blob:http://localhost/83e225a6c9ce2bac8adf311c3e67de6b)![Image 8: Predict](blob:http://localhost/d3717f8b551ce4e2a9b35e1641d61392)Predict](https://myriad.markets/?utm_source=decrypt&utm_campaign=navbar)[![Image 9: AI](blob:http://localhost/62ceb084dde83843d9887bdc1213ad1f)![Image 10: AI](blob:http://localhost/7aa2f6422d5e2e5af6a262ad86bf9b91)AI](https://decrypt.co/emerge)[![Image 11: Learn](blob:http://localhost/132e5adddd21434e4b62b0d79cacaf2c)![Image 12: Learn](blob:http://localhost/132e5adddd21434e4b62b0d79cacaf2c)Learn](https://decrypt.co/university)[![Image 13: Gaming](blob:http://localhost/e44cea5a102a4ce9cbe1c97f51994f1b)![Image 14: Gaming](blob:http://localhost/f89fd6ac9ca89f35ed6d49f4a70a6652)Gaming](https://decrypt.co/gg)\n./decrypt_full.md:363:### [ATOM](https://decrypt.co/price/cosmos)\n./decrypt_full.md:1279:[![Image 16](https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/themes/decrypt-media/assets/images/favicon-32x32.png) Decrypt](https://decrypt.co/)[News](https://decrypt.co/news)[Law and Order](https://decrypt.co/news/law)\n./decrypt_full.md:1327:[News](https://decrypt.co/news)[Law and Order](https://decrypt.co/news/law)\n./decrypt_full.md:1335:The FTX founder had [alleged](https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-02-10/sam-bankman-fried-asks-for-new-trial-over-ftx-fraud-charges) that Nishad Singh, the firm's head of engineering, had changed his story after \"threats from the government,\" and that two other executives, Daniel Chapsky and Ryan Salame, would dispute the prosecution's claims, but that they had declined to testify for fear of retaliation.\n./decrypt_full.md:1355:[News](https://decrypt.co/news)[Law and Order](https://decrypt.co/news/law)\n./decrypt_full.md:1365:### Daily Debrief Newsletter\n./decrypt_full.md:1367:Start every day with the top news stories right now, plus original features, a podcast, videos and more.\n./decrypt_full.md:1383:### Recommended News\n./decrypt_full.md:1389:[News](https://decrypt.co/news)[Law and Order](https://decrypt.co/news/law)  2 min read  Decrypt Agent Apr 28, 2026 Apr 28, 2026 Create an account to save your articles.      \n./decrypt_full.md:1394:[News](https://decrypt.co/news)[Law and Order](https://decrypt.co/news/law)  2 min read  Sander Lutz Apr 28, 2026 Apr 28, 2026 Create an account to save your articles.      \n./decrypt_full.md:1399:[News](https://decrypt.co/news)[Law and Order](https://decrypt.co/news/law)  3 min read  Decrypt Agent Apr 28, 2026 Apr 28, 2026 Create an account to save your articles.      \n./decrypt_full.md:1401:[All](https://decrypt.co/news)\n./decrypt_full.md:1411:[](https://twitter.com/decryptmedia \"X\")[](https://www.instagram.com/decryptmedia/ \"Instagram\")[](https://www.threads.com/@decryptmedia \"Threads\")[](https://www.linkedin.com/company/decrypt-media \"LinkedIn\")[](https://www.facebook.com/DecryptMediaOfficial/ \"Facebook\")[](https://decrypt.co/feed \"RSS Feed\")[](https://www.tiktok.com/@decryptmedia \"TikTok\")[](https://www.youtube.com/c/DecryptMedia \"Youtube\")[](https://flipboard.com/@DecryptMedia \"Flipboard\")[](https://t.me/DecryptNews \"Telegram\")\n./decrypt_full.md:1415:[News](https://decrypt.co/news)\n./decrypt_full.md:1425:[News Explorer](https://decrypt.co/news-explorer)\n./decrypt_full.md:1451:SUBSCRIBE TO OUR NEWSLETTER\n./decrypt_full.md:1452:The latest news, articles, and resources, sent to your inbox weekly.\n./fetch_rss.py:5:feeds = {\n./fetch_rss.py:6:    \"CoinDesk\": \"https://www.coindesk.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/\",\n./fetch_rss.py:7:    \"CoinTelegraph\": \"https://cointelegraph.com/rss\",\n./fetch_rss.py:8:    \"Decrypt\": \"https://decrypt.co/feed\"\n./fetch_rss.py:11:for name, url in feeds.items():\n./decrypt_bithumb.txt:14:[News](https://decrypt.co/news)[Learn](https://decrypt.co/university)[GG](https://decrypt.co/gg)[Emerge](https://decrypt.co/emerge)[Videos](https://decrypt.co/videos)[Newsletters](https://decrypt.co/newsletters)\n./decrypt_bithumb.txt:24:[![Image 5: News](blob:http://localhost/0aa0a8ee08caf3bcc8e7e488283150b2)![Image 6: News](blob:http://localhost/9a89213175e2fb47d512c1624a349836)News](https://decrypt.co/news)[![Image 7: Predict](blob:http://localhost/83e225a6c9ce2bac8adf311c3e67de6b)![Image 8: Predict](blob:http://localhost/d3717f8b551ce4e2a9b35e1641d61392)Predict](https://myriad.markets/?utm_source=decrypt&utm_campaign=navbar)[![Image 9: AI](blob:http://localhost/62ceb084dde83843d9887bdc1213ad1f)![Image 10: AI](blob:http://localhost/7aa2f6422d5e2e5af6a262ad86bf9b91)AI](https://decrypt.co/emerge)[![Image 11: Learn](blob:http://localhost/132e5adddd21434e4b62b0d79cacaf2c)![Image 12: Learn](blob:http://localhost/132e5adddd21434e4b62b0d79cacaf2c)Learn](https://decrypt.co/university)[![Image 13: Gaming](blob:http://localhost/e44cea5a102a4ce9cbe1c97f51994f1b)![Image 14: Gaming](blob:http://localhost/f89fd6ac9ca89f35ed6d49f4a70a6652)Gaming](https://decrypt.co/gg)\n./research_script.sh:4:url_cd=$(curl -sL \"https://www.coindesk.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/\" | grep -A 1 \"Aave raises nearly 80% of the\" | grep \"<link>\" | sed -e 's/<link>//' -e 's/<\\/link>//')\n./research_script.sh:5:url_ct=$(curl -sL \"https://cointelegraph.com/rss\" | grep -A 1 \"Aave asks Arbitrum\" | grep \"<link>\" | sed 's/.*<link><!\\[CDATA\\[//' | sed 's/]]><\\/link>//' | cut -d'?' -f1)\n./single_topic.json:11:    \"https://cointelegraph.com/news/arbitrum-dao-asked-to-unfreeze-30k-eth-tied-to-kelp-hacker-direct-them-to-defi-united\"","cwd":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-researcher"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779263018747}}
